{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1036405-need-a-book-reference-of-some-dragon-blooded","id":1036405,"title":"Need a book reference of some Dragon-Blooded","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-22T19:36:08-08:00","id":1036405,"title":"Need a book reference of some Dragon-Blooded","content":"Where is that picture of Tepet Ejava, Ragara Bhagwei, Mnemon, V'neef Bijar, Cathak Cainin and Ledaal Kes at the Elemental Dragon Throne? I swear I've see it, but I can't find which book it is in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T22:05:05-08:00","id":1036441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1036405-need-a-book-reference-of-some-dragon-blooded#post1036405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where is that picture of Tepet Ejava, Ragara Bhagwei, Mnemon, V'neef Bijar, Cathak Cainin and Ledaal Kes at the Elemental Dragon Throne? I swear I've see it, but I can't find which book it is in.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think this image exists.<br /> <br /> If I had to guess you're conflating three half-page splashes. There's art of the Empress on the Dragon Throne with Tepet Ejava kneeling before her and Cathak Cainan, Chejop Kejak and either Tepet Arada or Wise Wind in the background. It's on page 33 of the Exalted 2nd Edition corebook in my copy. Another has Regent Fokuf, Mnemon and Ejava on page 48 of the core; this is probably the main one you're thinking of since it accompanies a list of potential candidates for the Throne that includes most of the people you mentioned. There's also a piece with Princess V'neef, Princess Mnemon, Tepet Ejava, Cathak Cainan and two others I don't recognize in the 2nd Ed DB hardcover (page 49), with everyone drinking and having a good time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1564-shinjo","name":"Shinjo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T03:07:10-08:00","id":1036514,"title":"","content":"wasn't there like a tabletop exalted game or something like that (i have only seen the box at one of my friends house) that seemed to revolve around the realm civil war. maybe it was from there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T08:16:15-08:00","id":1036641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1036405-need-a-book-reference-of-some-dragon-blooded?p=1036514#post1036514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wasn't there like a tabletop exalted game or something like that (i have only seen the box at one of my friends house) that seemed to revolve around the realm civil war. maybe it was from there?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it was called <i>War for the Throne. </i>Or <i>Realm</i>. But yeah, its cover had at least a few of those characters on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T12:41:44-08:00","id":1036774,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the idea - I pulled out my copy of War for the Throne, but the rulebook has only one picture, of a sample of play. The event and Charm cards have some art, but they don't have the picture I'm looking for.<br /> <br /> As for the picture existing - I remember because I didn't know who V'neef Bijar was for the longest time, and then I put it together after reading the notables from Aspect: Fire. In this picture she's sneaking behind the throne, unseen from the other contenders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T12:44:21-08:00","id":1036776,"title":"","content":"Page 20, Return of the Scarlet Empress~!<br /> <br /> Thanks for the responses. You helped me wrack my brain and search my library.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https:/